{"version":1,"content":"<p>受內存、固態硬盤及其他關鍵零部件價格大幅上漲影響，全球個人電腦市場在2026年第三季度遭遇明顯下滑。市場研究機構Counterpoint Research的數據顯示，全球PC出貨量同比下降約21%，結束了此前持續兩年多的增長趨勢。隨着人工智能數據中心對內存資源的需求持續攀升，消費級電腦正面臨成本上升、低價機型供應減少以及消費者推遲換機等多重壓力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583452.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:59.848954+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:24:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_hash":"96a75fcc3023829f0a338df960c32f130976b754d823f8368ec1f4795cda492c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}